<p>Hello,</p>
<% if @day.zero? %>
  <p>We could not take the payment for your EsignCenter subscription. Cards get declined for all sorts of ordinary reasons — an expiry date that has passed, a new card, a bank asking for confirmation.</p>
<% elsif @late %>
  <%# The catch-up copy is sent on or after day 14, so it must not quote the
      day-13 clock it was scheduled against: it retried for the whole grace
      period, not for 13 days. %>
  <p>The payment for your EsignCenter subscription was never settled. We retried the card for the whole <%= @grace_days %>-day grace period.</p>
<% else %>
  <p>The payment for your EsignCenter subscription is still outstanding. We have been retrying it for <%= @day %> days.</p>
<% end %>
<%# The catch-up tick: this letter and the suspension notice go out together,
    so the future tense below would be wrong in both halves — the freeze is
    not coming, it has happened. The suspension email says what that means in
    full; this one just tells the truth about when. %>
<% if @late %>
  <p>The <%= @grace_days %>-day grace period has now run out, so <strong>the account was suspended today</strong>. Everyone can still sign in, and every document stays readable, downloadable and exportable — signers already part-way through a document still finish it — but nothing new can be created or changed until the payment goes through. A separate email covers this in full.</p>
<% else %>
  <p>Nothing has changed on your account yet: you can send, sign and download exactly as before, and we will keep retrying the card.</p>
  <% if @suspends_on %>
    <p><strong>What happens if it is not settled:</strong> on <%= @suspends_on.utc.strftime('%-d %B %Y') %> the account is suspended. A suspended account can still be signed into, and every document stays readable, downloadable and exportable — signers already part-way through a document still finish it — but nothing new can be created or changed until the payment goes through.</p>
  <% else %>
    <p><strong>What happens if it is not settled:</strong> after <%= @grace_days %> days the account is suspended — still readable, downloadable and exportable, but nothing new can be created until the payment goes through.</p>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
<p>Updating the card takes a minute, and paying lifts everything by itself.</p>
<p><%= link_to 'Update your payment method', @billing_url %></p>
<p>Thanks,<br>EsignCenter</p>
